{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review remediation: addressed the child-material fingerprint concern explicitly. The old material_fingerprint hashes children by id only; this ticket does not pretend that fingerprint verifies titles/descriptions. It verifies child-material faithfulness through deterministic timestamp-gated CREATE/EDIT LWW replay tests and withholds legacy/malformed/unrecoverable cases rather than admitting degraded rosters."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788996457484705001,"uuid":"c2824fb2-eb4f-4a2b-8160-8c7d551d4500"}